<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h2 data-lake-id="hDedJ" id="hDedJ" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u2c3f2b8f" id="u2c3f2b8f">🍄</span><span data-lake-id="u621ee561" id="u621ee561"> 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐅𝐫𝐚𝐦𝐞𝐰𝐨𝐫𝐤</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u6052d36b" id="u6052d36b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1660b39b" id="u1660b39b">DeepSeek-V3 在配备 2048 张 NVIDIA H800 GPU 的集群上进行训练。H800 集群的每个节点包含 8 张 GPU，节点内通过 NVLink 和 NVSwitch 连接。不同节点之间使用 InfiniBand（IB）互连进行通信</span></strong></p><ul list="ue4d30ab0"><li fid="ua902b6b8" data-lake-id="ud8ae26dc" id="ud8ae26dc"><span data-lake-id="uf3249818" id="uf3249818">DeepSeek-V3 的训练由 HAI-LLM 框架支持。DeepSeek-V3 采用 16 路流水线并行、跨越 8 个节点的 64 路专家并行，以及 ZeRO-1 数据并行</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua55c5f21" id="ua55c5f21"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue29ef2f1" id="ue29ef2f1">为实现 DeepSeek-V3 的高效训练，作者进行细致的工程优化</span></strong></p><ul list="u268d21cd"><li fid="ud104f978" data-lake-id="uf6fe81bc" id="uf6fe81bc"><span data-lake-id="u97ed28b2" id="u97ed28b2">首先，设计用于高效流水线并行的 DualPipe 算法。与现有 PP 方法相比，DualPipe 的流水线气泡更少。更重要的是，它使前向与反向过程中的计算阶段和通信阶段重叠执行，从而应对跨节点专家并行带来的高通信开销</span></li><li fid="ud104f978" data-lake-id="u6d5c5329" id="u6d5c5329"><span data-lake-id="ud256628c" id="ud256628c">其次，开发高效的跨节点 all-to-all 通信内核，以充分利用 IB 和 NVLink 带宽，并减少通信占用的流式多处理器数量</span></li><li fid="ud104f978" data-lake-id="ucd33844d" id="ucd33844d"><span data-lake-id="ua2ad59ef" id="ua2ad59ef">最后，细致优化训练过程中的内存占用，使得在不使用开销较大的张量并行的情况下训练 DeepSeek-V3 成为可能</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc1b3fdc7" id="uc1b3fdc7"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc01b534d" id="uc01b534d" style="color: #DF2A3F">对于 DeepSeek-V3，跨节点专家并行引入的通信开销使计算与通信之比约为 1:1，效率较低。作者设计一种创新的流水线并行算法 DualPipe。该算法通过有效重叠前向与反向过程中的计算和通信阶段，加速模型训练，同时减少流水线气泡</span></strong></p><ul list="uc12302f8"><li fid="ud94f447e" data-lake-id="u97561e6e" id="u97561e6e"><span data-lake-id="uac9ad59e" id="uac9ad59e">DualPipe 的核心思想是使一对前向与反向计算块中的计算与通信重叠执行。具体而言，每个计算块被划分为四个组成部分：注意力计算、all-to-all 分发（dispatch）、MLP 计算和 all-to-all 合并（combine）</span></li><li fid="ud94f447e" data-lake-id="u18ea1471" id="u18ea1471"><span data-lake-id="ue1312a71" id="ue1312a71">特别地，对于反向计算块，注意力计算和 MLP 计算都会进一步拆分为输入梯度计算和权重梯度计算两部分，与 ZeroBubble 中的做法类似。此外，还有一个 PP 通信组件</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue9cb2e34" id="ue9cb2e34" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790612928164-7fb28aa6-507c-4e8c-aa50-d61fd63bd9b3.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u5f1cdc25-beba-4679-8869-ccb8746867b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u1c5bea7f-b4b8-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A759.2%2C%22height%22%3A101%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A35949%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A949%2C%22originHeight%22%3A126%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22BACKWARDCHUNK%22%2C%22x%22%3A513%2C%22y%22%3A102%2C%22width%22%3A133%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AFORWARDCHUN%22%2C%22x%22%3A298%2C%22y%22%3A102%2C%22width%22%3A120%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DISPATCHFA%22%2C%22x%22%3A129%2C%22y%22%3A50%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMBINEFA%22%2C%22x%22%3A525%2C%22y%22%3A51%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMBINEB)A%22%2C%22x%22%3A762%2C%22y%22%3A51%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DISPATCH(B)A%22%2C%22x%22%3A290%2C%22y%22%3A51%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ATTNFA%22%2C%22x%22%3A811%2C%22y%22%3A29%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TTNWW%22%2C%22x%22%3A720%2C%22y%22%3A29%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OMMUNICATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A20%2C%22y%22%3A52%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MLPW%22%2C%22x%22%3A234%2C%22y%22%3A28%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ATTNB)%22%2C%22x%22%3A544%2C%22y%22%3A29%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MLP(B)A%22%2C%22x%22%3A134%2C%22y%22%3A28%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MLPFA%22%2C%22x%22%3A327%2C%22y%22%3A28%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMPUTATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A21%2C%22y%22%3A28%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TIME%22%2C%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A74%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23ede9b6%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u06659756%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc12302f8" start="3"><li fid="ud94f447e" data-lake-id="uf862262b" id="uf862262b"><span data-lake-id="u3f0bbf17" id="u3f0bbf17">对于一对前向与反向计算块，作者重新安排这些组件，并手动调整分配给通信与计算的 GPU SM 数量比例。通过这种重叠策略，可以确保 all-to-all 通信和 PP 通信在执行过程中均被完全隐藏。DualPipe 采用双向流水线调度，同时从流水线两端输入微批次，使相当大一部分通信能够被完全重叠。随着模型规模进一步扩大，只要保持计算与通信的比例不变，就仍然能够跨节点使用细粒度专家，同时实现接近于零的 all-to-all 通信开销</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3d011b48" id="u3d011b48" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790613056358-98618f2c-ce63-480a-b519-f1e497225bbf.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ue37cd6bd-99d7-45fa-b89b-7be0cac762e%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u1c5bea7f-b4b8-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A945%2C%22height%22%3A166%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A101472%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1527%2C%22originHeight%22%3A268%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AF%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A596%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A681%2C%22height%22%3A187%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22123456%22%2C%22x%22%3A120%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A128%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OVERAPPEDFORWARD%26BACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A883%2C%22y%22%3A238%2C%22width%22%3A253%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22787989%22%2C%22x%22%3A1319%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A188%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2266778899%22%2C%22x%22%3A1335%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A177%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221002113%22%2C%22x%22%3A267%2C%22y%22%3A159%2C%22width%22%3A181%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2201234%22%2C%22x%22%3A89%2C%22y%22%3A46%2C%22width%22%3A152%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACKWARDFORWEIGHTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A667%2C%22y%22%3A235%2C%22width%22%3A210%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22234%22%2C%22x%22%3A221%2C%22y%22%3A91%2C%22width%22%3A148%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEVICE1%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A49%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22898%22%2C%22x%22%3A1330%2C%22y%22%3A94%2C%22width%22%3A159%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEVICE3%22%2C%22x%22%3A25%2C%22y%22%3A97%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEVICE6%22%2C%22x%22%3A25%2C%22y%22%3A165%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EVICE%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A144%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A602%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A137%2C%22height%22%3A184%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEVICE0%22%2C%22x%22%3A20%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EVICE%22%2C%22x%22%3A32%2C%22y%22%3A191%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22230%22%2C%22x%22%3A254%2C%22y%22%3A110%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22001112223%22%2C%22x%22%3A266%2C%22y%22%3A186%2C%22width%22%3A195%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2220031%22%2C%22x%22%3A278%2C%22y%22%3A135%2C%22width%22%3A183%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEVICE2%22%2C%22x%22%3A20%2C%22y%22%3A72%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEVICE4%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACKWARDFORINPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A484%2C%22y%22%3A239%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2299%22%2C%22x%22%3A1341%2C%22y%22%3A141%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TIME%22%2C%22x%22%3A36%2C%22y%22%3A212%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%22%2C%22x%22%3A344%2C%22y%22%3A42%2C%22width%22%3A134%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2289%22%2C%22x%22%3A1403%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23d3950c%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u65247da6%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc12302f8" start="4"><li fid="ud94f447e" data-lake-id="ufcc1ee98" id="ufcc1ee98"><span data-lake-id="ub7056102" id="ub7056102">尽管 DualPipe 需要保留两份模型参数，但由于训练时采用较大的 EP 规模，这并不会显著增加内存消耗。DualPipe 仅要求流水线阶段数和微批次数均能被 2 整除，而不要求微批次数能被流水线阶段数整除。此外，对于 DualPipe，流水线气泡和激活内存占用均不会随着微批次数量的增加而增长</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud0fa7ce9" id="ud0fa7ce9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790613086160-a7d46916-01db-42c6-8687-d057089fd784.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u77c43d42-e5df-4125-98f7-4b2c8fed035%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u1c5bea7f-b4b8-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A782%2C%22height%22%3A147%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A65634%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1421%2C%22originHeight%22%3A268%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AD%A6-1)(F%26B%2BB-3W)%22%2C%22x%22%3A448%2C%22y%22%3A191%2C%22width%22%3A354%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(PP-1)(F%2BB-2W)%22%2C%22x%22%3A456%2C%22y%22%3A147%2C%22width%22%3A322%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DUALPIPE(OURS)%22%2C%22x%22%3A63%2C%22y%22%3A189%2C%22width%22%3A289%2C%22height%22%3A39%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(PP-1)(F%2BB)%22%2C%22x%22%3A493%2C%22y%22%3A102%2C%22width%22%3A250%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACTIVATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A1169%2C%22y%22%3A44%2C%22width%22%3A179%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PARAMETER%22%2C%22x%22%3A895%2C%22y%22%3A43%2C%22width%22%3A179%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BUBBLE%22%2C%22x%22%3A558%2C%22y%22%3A41%2C%22width%22%3A127%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MLETHOD%22%2C%22x%22%3A136%2C%22y%22%3A41%2C%22width%22%3A138%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ZB1P%22%2C%22x%22%3A153%2C%22y%22%3A146%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PP%2B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A1207%2C%22y%22%3A194%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221F1B%22%2C%22x%22%3A162%2C%22y%22%3A99%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PP%22%2C%22x%22%3A1227%2C%22y%22%3A148%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PP%22%2C%22x%22%3A1224%2C%22y%22%3A103%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221X%22%2C%22x%22%3A958%2C%22y%22%3A102%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221X%22%2C%22x%22%3A963%2C%22y%22%3A144%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222X%22%2C%22x%22%3A960%2C%22y%22%3A191%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2f1f0%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ud9658997%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u3ff76b0e" id="u3ff76b0e"><strong><span data-lake-id="uee78b88c" id="uee78b88c">为确保 DualPipe 具有充足的计算性能，作者定制高效的跨节点 all-to-all 通信内核，包括分发和合并，以减少通信占用的 SM 数量。这些内核的实现与 MoE 门控算法及集群网络拓扑进行协同设计</span></strong></p><ul list="ua77d9f59"><li fid="uaa77e368" data-lake-id="u43a6c18b" id="u43a6c18b"><span data-lake-id="ue7796ba6" id="ue7796ba6">具体而言，在该集群中，跨节点 GPU 通过 IB 全互连，节点内通信则通过 NVLink 完成。NVLink 的带宽为 160 GB/s，约为 IB 带宽（50 GB/s）的 3.2 倍。为有效利用 IB 与 NVLink 的带宽差异，作者将每个 token 的分发范围限制为最多 4 个节点，从而减少 IB 流量</span></li><li fid="uaa77e368" data-lake-id="ue40c752a" id="ue40c752a"><span data-lake-id="u221687d0" id="u221687d0">对于每个 token，在确定路由决策后，首先通过 IB 将其传输至目标节点中具有相同节点内编号的 GPU。到达目标节点后，作者尽可能确保该 token 立即通过 NVLink 转发至承载其目标专家的特定 GPU，而不被随后到达的 token 阻塞。通过这种方式，IB 与 NVLink 通信得以完全重叠，每个 token 可以高效地在每个节点上平均选择 3.2 个专家，而不引入额外的 NVLink 开销</span></li><li fid="uaa77e368" data-lake-id="u48ba2933" id="u48ba2933"><span data-lake-id="u0e85ea82" id="u0e85ea82">具体而言，作者采用 warp 专业化技术，将 20 个 SM 划分为 10 个通信通道。在分发过程中，IB 发送、IB 到 NVLink 的转发，以及NVLink 接收，分别由不同的 warp 处理。分配给各通信任务的 warp 数量，根据所有 SM 上的实际工作负载进行动态调整</span></li><li fid="uaa77e368" data-lake-id="u034d1b7d" id="u034d1b7d"><span data-lake-id="u432d2ef2" id="u432d2ef2">类似地，在合并过程中，NVLink 发送、NVLink 到 IB 的转发与累加，以及 IB 接收与累加，也由动态调整数量的 warp 处理</span></li><li fid="uaa77e368" data-lake-id="u063e638a" id="u063e638a"><span data-lake-id="u3e65c3aa" id="u3e65c3aa">此外，分发和合并内核均与计算流重叠执行，因此作者也考虑它们对其他 SM 上计算内核的影响。具体而言，作者采用自定义的 PTX 指令，并自动调优通信数据块的大小，从而显著减少 L2 缓存的使用以及对其他 SM 的干扰</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2e50b83e" id="u2e50b83e"><strong><span data-lake-id="uae41d297" id="uae41d297">重计算 RMSNorm 和 MLA 上投影。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud69b57fa" id="ud69b57fa">在反向传播过程中，作者重新计算所有 RMSNorm 操作和 MLA 上投影，从而无须持续保存其输出激活。该策略仅引入少量开销，便显著降低存储激活所需的内存</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3d4039ac" id="u3d4039ac"><strong><span data-lake-id="u12b05f17" id="u12b05f17">在 CPU 中维护指数移动平均。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u157be87c" id="u157be87c">在训练过程中，作者维护模型参数的指数移动平均，用于提前估计学习率衰减后的模型性能。EMA 参数存储在 CPU 内存中，并在每个训练步骤结束后异步更新。该方法使得作者能够在不引入额外内存或时间开销的情况下维护 EMA 参数</span></p><p data-lake-id="u841dfa05" id="u841dfa05"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5fbda13e" id="u5fbda13e">多 token 预测中的共享嵌入层与输出头。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uda3115c4" id="uda3115c4">采用 DualPipe 策略时，作者将模型最浅的层（包括嵌入层）和最深的层（包括输出头）部署在同一个 PP rank 上。这一安排使 MTP 模块与主模型能够在物理上共享嵌入层和输出头的参数及梯度。该物理共享机制进一步提高内存效率</span></p>